--- !u!114 &1483488382646939247
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 2993891137716942019}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 93b5b8cb0fe97534ca0b87e86b9ca03b, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  instructionTextUI: {fileID: 6608417736738639757}
  inspectionSteps:
  - instructionText: Welcome, Beekeeper! Before we begin, ensure your virtual suit
      and gloves are on. (Press Next to continue)
    objectToHighlight: {fileID: 2816712077206770597}
    requiredInteractableObject: {fileID: 5153779749438701993}
    waitForInteraction: 1
    autoAdvanceDelay: 0
    onStepStart:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onStepComplete:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls:
        - m_Target: {fileID: 1483488382646939247}
          m_TargetAssemblyTypeName: HiveInspectionGuideManager, Assembly-CSharp
          m_MethodName: AdvanceGuideManually
          m_Mode: 1
          m_Arguments:
            m_ObjectArgument: {fileID: 0}
            m_ObjectArgumentAssemblyTypeName: UnityEngine.Object, UnityEngine
            m_IntArgument: 0
            m_FloatArgument: 0
            m_StringArgument: 
            m_BoolArgument: 0
          m_CallState: 2
  - instructionText: Carefully remove the inner lid and place it gently beside the
      hive, upside down.
    objectToHighlight: {fileID: 8392540215618083448}
    requiredInteractableObject: {fileID: 9206917776472701863}
    waitForInteraction: 1
    autoAdvanceDelay: 0
    onStepStart:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onStepComplete:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls:
        - m_Target: {fileID: 1483488382646939247}
          m_TargetAssemblyTypeName: HiveInspectionGuideManager, Assembly-CSharp
          m_MethodName: AdvanceGuideManually
          m_Mode: 1
          m_Arguments:
            m_ObjectArgument: {fileID: 0}
            m_ObjectArgumentAssemblyTypeName: UnityEngine.Object, UnityEngine
            m_IntArgument: 0
            m_FloatArgument: 0
            m_StringArgument: 
            m_BoolArgument: 0
          m_CallState: 2
  - instructionText: Wait for the Bees to Settle down before continuing (or say "STOP"
      To freeze the bees in place if being surrounded by a swarm of bees makes you
      uncomfortable. You will get used to it, and having this control helps overcome
      the fear of bees)
    objectToHighlight: {fileID: 0}
    requiredInteractableObject: {fileID: 0}
    waitForInteraction: 0
    autoAdvanceDelay: 7
    onStepStart:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onStepComplete:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls:
        - m_Target: {fileID: 1483488382646939247}
          m_TargetAssemblyTypeName: HiveInspectionGuideManager, Assembly-CSharp
          m_MethodName: AdvanceGuideManually
          m_Mode: 1
          m_Arguments:
            m_ObjectArgument: {fileID: 0}
            m_ObjectArgumentAssemblyTypeName: UnityEngine.Object, UnityEngine
            m_IntArgument: 0
            m_FloatArgument: 0
            m_StringArgument: 
            m_BoolArgument: 0
          m_CallState: 2
  - instructionText: It's Time to actually inspect our hive! Carefully grab one frame
      and slowly pull it out of the box. We usually want to start in the center where
      most bee's tend to focus there efforts. If the Hive is Healthy it should be
      covered in bees.
    objectToHighlight: {fileID: 8165434162033761752}
    requiredInteractableObject: {fileID: 4175995545074662409}
    waitForInteraction: 1
    autoAdvanceDelay: 0
    onStepStart:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onStepComplete:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls:
        - m_Target: {fileID: 1483488382646939247}
          m_TargetAssemblyTypeName: HiveInspectionGuideManager, Assembly-CSharp
          m_MethodName: AdvanceGuideManually
          m_Mode: 1
          m_Arguments:
            m_ObjectArgument: {fileID: 0}
            m_ObjectArgumentAssemblyTypeName: UnityEngine.Object, UnityEngine
            m_IntArgument: 0
            m_FloatArgument: 0
            m_StringArgument: 
            m_BoolArgument: 0
          m_CallState: 2
  - instructionText: Finally We want to find our QUEEN! If we see her, we know everything
      is OK.
    objectToHighlight: {fileID: 6290172527528522781}
    requiredInteractableObject: {fileID: 204678061725832608}
    waitForInteraction: 1
    autoAdvanceDelay: 2
    onStepStart:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onStepComplete:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls:
        - m_Target: {fileID: 1483488382646939247}
          m_TargetAssemblyTypeName: HiveInspectionGuideManager, Assembly-CSharp
          m_MethodName: AdvanceGuideManually
          m_Mode: 1
          m_Arguments:
            m_ObjectArgument: {fileID: 0}
            m_ObjectArgumentAssemblyTypeName: UnityEngine.Object, UnityEngine
            m_IntArgument: 0
            m_FloatArgument: 0
            m_StringArgument: 
            m_BoolArgument: 0
          m_CallState: 2
  - instructionText: That's It! You have successfully inspected you HIVE and found
      everything going smoothly! Now put everything back where you found it and let
      your preciuos bees continue to save the world!
    objectToHighlight: {fileID: 0}
    requiredInteractableObject: {fileID: 0}
    waitForInteraction: 0
    autoAdvanceDelay: 20
    onStepStart:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onStepComplete:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls:
        - m_Target: {fileID: 1483488382646939247}
          m_TargetAssemblyTypeName: HiveInspectionGuideManager, Assembly-CSharp
          m_MethodName: AdvanceGuideManually
          m_Mode: 1
          m_Arguments:
            m_ObjectArgument: {fileID: 0}
            m_ObjectArgumentAssemblyTypeName: UnityEngine.Object, UnityEngine
            m_IntArgument: 0
            m_FloatArgument: 0
            m_StringArgument: 
            m_BoolArgument: 0
          m_CallState: 2
  - instructionText: THANK YOU FOR PLAYING AND FOR YOUR INTEREST IN BEE KEEPING!
    objectToHighlight: {fileID: 0}
    requiredInteractableObject: {fileID: 0}
    waitForInteraction: 0
    autoAdvanceDelay: 20
    onStepStart:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onStepComplete:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
